WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:00.367
On the

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.635
eve of the first round,

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.604
you told your supporters

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.172
that the US President

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:08.308
had given instructions to, quote,

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:09.843
topple you.

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.311
Do you have any evidence

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:12.145
to suggest

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:14.381
that the US President is meddling

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:16.883
in these Turkish elections, that he gave

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:20.620
instructions to topple you

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:24.057
 

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:24.824
Mr.

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:26.526
Biden statement to this effect

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:29.095
before he was elected was recorded on TV.

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:30.330
Unfortunately,

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.132
and we listen to his words on TV

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:33.933
and we were upset.

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:35.702
I spoke to him about it later

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.771
at an international summit,

00:00:37.771 --> 00:00:38.738
and I told him that

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:41.174
I was deeply upset by his remarks

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:43.343
and that I didn't expect this from him.

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:44.811
You called him out

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:46.780
for calling you an autocrat

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.882
in his election campaign

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:51.751
before the US elections.

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:55.255
That is not the same as suggesting

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:58.525
that he is meddling in these elections

00:00:58.525 --> 00:00:59.959
and wants to topple you.

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:01.995
Do you genuinely believe,

00:01:01.995 --> 00:01:03.930
as you suggested last Saturday,

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:07.634
that Joe Biden wants to topple you?

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:10.003
 

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:10.804
How could someone

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:12.739
who is going into a runoff election

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:13.840
instead of completing

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:15.408
the election in the first round

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:16.910
be a dictator?

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:19.712
That is the reality we have an alliance

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:22.382
with 322 MPs in parliament

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:23.616
and the leader of this

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:25.718
alliance is going to go for the runoffs

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:27.520
in the first position.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.255
What kind of a dictator is that?

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:32.092
It will introduce you to the judicious.

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:33.660
So if reelected.

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.595
Are you saying that you will work

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:37.197
with the Biden administration?

00:01:37.197 --> 00:01:37.997
You can work

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:39.499
with the Biden administration

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:41.301
 

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:42.602
without a doubt.

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:44.370
I will work with Mr. Biden.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.306
And if Biden goes, then I will work

00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:48.274
with whoever replaces him as well.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:51.177
Also, the US would like Turkey to take

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:52.512
a stronger stance

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:56.216
against Russia, particularly with regard

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:58.118
enforcing sanctions

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.519
in April of this year.

00:01:59.519 --> 00:01:59.986
The US

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:03.123
imposed sanctions on at least for Turkey

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:04.190
based entities

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:07.227
it said were violating US export

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:10.263
controls and helping Russia's war effort.

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:12.665
President Erdogan, is Turkey

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:15.602
helping Russia evade sanctions?

00:02:16.436 --> 00:02:18.338
And will you abide

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:20.440
by US sanctions on Russia?

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.208
 

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:24.277
We have no problems with our relationship

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:25.378
with Russia at the moment,

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:26.746
and we are not at a point

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:28.848
where we would impose sanctions on Russia

00:02:28.882 --> 00:02:30.683
like the West have done.

00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:32.785
We are not bound by the West's sanctions

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:34.020
as Turkey.

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.355
We are a strong state

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:36.723
and we have positive relations

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:37.757
with Russia.

00:02:38.024 --> 00:02:39.993
In terms of our foreign trade volume,

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:41.995
we've reached an ideal level with Russia.

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:44.664
When you look at our tourism numbers,

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:46.766
Russia is number one.

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:48.434
They are unfortunately

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:49.836
because of the latest statements

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:51.638
by the main opposition party.

00:02:51.638 --> 00:02:52.405
Many tourists

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:54.541
are going to other destinations.

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:55.742
I won't be a leader

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:56.709
that makes the mistake

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:58.411
of missing the tourists from Russia

00:02:58.411 --> 00:02:59.112
or Ukraine.

00:03:00.713 --> 00:03:02.815
You've said that you don't agree

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:06.186
with the attitude of the West towards

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:07.220
Russia.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:10.590
With regard the Ukraine conflict,

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.791
that the West follows

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:13.860
a policy based on provocation.

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:16.029
I just want you to explain

00:03:16.296 --> 00:03:17.830
a little more what you mean.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.599
Do you believe, for example,

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:21.401
that the massive military

00:03:21.401 --> 00:03:24.504
and financial aid going to Ukraine

00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:27.707
is a provocation?

00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:30.610
 

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:31.811
the West is not leading

00:03:31.811 --> 00:03:33.479
a very balanced approach.

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:34.747
You need a balanced approach

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:36.616
towards a country such as Russia.

00:03:36.616 --> 00:03:38.151
Which would have been a much more

00:03:38.151 --> 00:03:39.452
fortunate approach

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:40.887
than seeing Putin,

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:41.955
for example,

00:03:41.955 --> 00:03:44.457
the Black Sea Green Corridor Initiative.

00:03:44.457 --> 00:03:46.092
But we are not only considering

00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:46.659
the interests

00:03:46.659 --> 00:03:48.494
and the needs of the Western countries,

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:50.563
but also that of the African nations.

00:03:51.097 --> 00:03:52.498
But this Green Corridor

00:03:52.498 --> 00:03:53.733
initiative has been extended

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:55.001
for another two months,

00:03:55.001 --> 00:03:57.203
beginning on the 18th of May.

00:03:57.203 --> 00:03:58.638
How do you think it was possible?

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:00.240
It was

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:01.274
possible because of

00:04:01.274 --> 00:04:02.342
our special relationship

00:04:02.342 --> 00:04:04.143
with President Putin

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:07.013
I joined the UN inspectors

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:08.248
on one of the ships

00:04:08.248 --> 00:04:09.682
anchored of Istanbul

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:10.650
just yesterday

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.151
ahead of

00:04:12.151 --> 00:04:15.021
the decision to extend that deal.

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:16.055
It is

00:04:16.422 --> 00:04:19.859
such an important decision and mediating

00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:21.894
that is a good example

00:04:21.894 --> 00:04:25.131
of the unique position that Turkey plays.

00:04:25.531 --> 00:04:26.666
 

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:29.702
Becky,

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:30.903
It's very important

00:04:30.903 --> 00:04:33.439
as to where we stand today.

00:04:33.473 --> 00:04:35.942
This is where we are this afternoon.

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:38.144
Istanbul convention was signed here,

00:04:38.144 --> 00:04:40.313
right where we are seated.

00:04:40.313 --> 00:04:41.347
There used to be tables

00:04:41.347 --> 00:04:43.950
on which we have signed that convention.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.852
And this is where we have given a message

00:04:45.852 --> 00:04:47.687
to the rest of the world.

00:04:47.687 --> 00:04:49.922
And the same thing was repeated here.

00:04:49.922 --> 00:04:51.758
We are still following the developments

00:04:51.758 --> 00:04:53.326
where we stand.

00:04:53.359 --> 00:04:55.395
Let's talk about this for hundreds

00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:57.630
And the controversy

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.499
that that has created.

00:04:59.499 --> 00:05:01.734
The purchase of those from from Russia,

00:05:01.734 --> 00:05:03.169
the problems that that has created

00:05:03.169 --> 00:05:05.104
for your relationship with Washington.

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:05.772
It was the

00:05:05.772 --> 00:05:08.941
purchase of those S-400 systems

00:05:09.409 --> 00:05:12.245
that got Turkey expelled from the F-35

00:05:12.512 --> 00:05:14.147
fighter jet program.

00:05:14.147 --> 00:05:16.115
Do you still have

00:05:16.115 --> 00:05:16.816
any hope

00:05:16.816 --> 00:05:17.550
that you'll be able

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:21.087
to acquire F-35s in the future,

00:05:21.087 --> 00:05:22.422
or have you got to the point

00:05:22.422 --> 00:05:24.257
where you say, we don't need them?

00:05:24.257 --> 00:05:26.859
We will have our own domestic defense

00:05:27.427 --> 00:05:28.628
sector going forward.

00:05:28.628 --> 00:05:30.930
We don't need to buy from others.

00:05:32.665 --> 00:05:33.666
 

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.768
during the Trump presidency,

00:05:35.768 --> 00:05:37.203
the US had a wrong approach

00:05:37.203 --> 00:05:39.972
regarding the S-400s. Why?

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:42.141
If we are a free democratic country

00:05:42.141 --> 00:05:44.277
taking part in a liberal global market,

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:45.611
if I cannot purchase

00:05:45.611 --> 00:05:47.347
the defense system from the U.S.,

00:05:47.347 --> 00:05:48.147
then it's the U.S.

00:05:48.147 --> 00:05:49.048
that pushes us

00:05:49.048 --> 00:05:50.283
to buy a different system

00:05:50.283 --> 00:05:52.385
from a different country.

00:05:52.952 --> 00:05:54.454
We couldn't purchase those systems

00:05:54.454 --> 00:05:55.922
from the United States.

00:05:55.922 --> 00:05:56.856
That's why

00:05:56.856 --> 00:05:59.025
I bought the equivalent from Russia.

00:05:59.025 --> 00:06:01.127
Russia then is to.

00:06:01.127 --> 00:06:02.362
And when the F-35s

00:06:02.362 --> 00:06:03.629
were not delivered to us,

00:06:03.629 --> 00:06:04.797
we were very upset

00:06:04.797 --> 00:06:07.066
because we are nato allies.

00:06:07.066 --> 00:06:08.801
Turkey is one of the most significant

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:10.303
members of neato.

00:06:10.303 --> 00:06:11.304
That's when we started

00:06:11.304 --> 00:06:12.438
looking at the alternatives,

00:06:12.438 --> 00:06:13.773
when we saw the attitude

00:06:13.773 --> 00:06:15.842
of the Americans about the F-35.

00:06:16.142 --> 00:06:18.911
We told them to at least provide us F-16s

00:06:19.212 --> 00:06:20.480
and the necessary parts.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.348
So we continue our relations

00:06:22.348 --> 00:06:24.384
in a determined manner. In the current.

00:06:24.917 --> 00:06:26.452
There are some positive developments

00:06:26.452 --> 00:06:27.620
in that regard.

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:29.455
I hope that these positive developments

00:06:29.455 --> 00:06:32.258
will continue

00:06:33.559 --> 00:06:33.893
Are you

00:06:33.893 --> 00:06:35.261
ready to support

00:06:35.261 --> 00:06:37.463
Sweden's NATO membership?

00:06:37.897 --> 00:06:40.666
So as long as Sweden continues

00:06:40.666 --> 00:06:42.201
to allow the offshoots of terror

00:06:42.201 --> 00:06:44.437
groups in Turkey to roam free in Sweden

00:06:44.637 --> 00:06:46.172
in the streets of Stockholm,

00:06:46.172 --> 00:06:47.340
we cannot look favorably

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.142
on Sweden's membership in Nieto.

00:06:49.142 --> 00:06:49.876
President Erdogan,

00:06:49.876 --> 00:06:53.379
are you
saying that you are not yet prepared

00:06:53.913 --> 00:06:56.048
to agree

00:06:56.082 --> 00:06:57.417
to Sweden's

00:06:57.417 --> 00:07:00.219
accession to NATO's is switching under?

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.622
We're not ready for Sweden

00:07:02.622 --> 00:07:05.191
We're not ready for Sweden right now.

00:07:05.191 --> 00:07:07.326
First, they need to solve this issue

00:07:07.326 --> 00:07:08.461
because NATO countries

00:07:08.461 --> 00:07:09.729
should have a strong stance

00:07:09.729 --> 00:07:11.431
when it comes to fighting terrorism.

00:07:11.431 --> 00:07:12.632
And they should not allow

00:07:12.632 --> 00:07:14.100
any terror groups to run freely

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.469
in their streets against a NATO country

00:07:16.736 --> 00:07:19.405
because this is what makes NATO special

00:07:19.405 --> 00:07:20.273
leave us. 

00:07:20.907 --> 00:07:24.043
How do you see Turkey's relationship

00:07:24.043 --> 00:07:25.912
with this wider

00:07:25.912 --> 00:07:28.080
Middle Eastern Gulf region developing

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.149
going forward? 

00:07:31.117 --> 00:07:33.219
 

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:34.020
There was a period

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.888
when I was seriously upset,

00:07:35.888 --> 00:07:37.924
but that's in the past now. 22.

00:07:38.257 --> 00:07:39.091
Right now

00:07:39.091 --> 00:07:40.593
we see Saudi Arabia,

00:07:40.593 --> 00:07:42.028
Egypt, Qatar,

00:07:42.028 --> 00:07:42.662
Kuwait,

00:07:42.662 --> 00:07:44.597
UAE, all of the Gulf

00:07:44.597 --> 00:07:46.265
as brotherly nations.

00:07:46.265 --> 00:07:48.468
It's not right for us to remain at odds.

00:07:48.468 --> 00:07:50.470
We've moved past that.

00:07:51.037 --> 00:07:51.671
We've started

00:07:51.671 --> 00:07:53.506
state visits to Saudi Arabia,

00:07:53.506 --> 00:07:55.575
UAE, Qatar, Kuwait.

00:07:55.575 --> 00:07:57.009
And after the elections,

00:07:57.009 --> 00:07:59.111
I hope relations will expand

00:07:59.111 --> 00:08:00.079
on the political,

00:08:00.079 --> 00:08:02.248
military, commercial cultural

00:08:02.448 --> 00:08:03.916
and economic fronts.

00:08:03.916 --> 00:08:05.818
And we will take the necessary steps

00:08:05.818 --> 00:08:07.086
to improve our relations

00:08:07.086 --> 00:08:08.621
with the Gulf states.

00:08:08.621 --> 00:08:10.590
 

